function levelControls(id,mode='force',compact=false){const e=exercises[id],step=stepFor(state,id,mode),index=mode==='hypertrophy'?state.hypertrophyLevels[id]:e.major?state.progress[e.lineId][mode]:state.levels[id],max=e.modes[mode].steps.length-1,powerWarning=mode==='power'&&index===0&&!powerExplosiveAvailable(state,e.lineId),noun=mode==='hypertrophy'?'Niveau':'Palier';return`<div class="tier-control ${compact?'compact-controls':''}" role="group" aria-label="${noun} de ${esc(e.name)}">${button('−','level','stepper',`data-id="${id}" data-mode="${mode}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="${noun} inférieur" ${index===0?'disabled':''}`)}<span><small>${noun}</small><strong>${mode==='hypertrophy'?'N':'P'}${step.level}/${step.levels}</strong></span>${button('+','level','stepper',`data-id="${id}" data-mode="${mode}" data-delta="1" aria-label="${noun} supérieur" ${index===max?'disabled':''}`)}</div><p class="tier-prescription">${prescriptionForStep(step)}</p>${powerWarning?'<p class="recommendation pain compact">Puissance déconseillée actuellement : les passages préparatoires restent recommandés.</p>':''}`;}
